    <briefdescription>
<para>A convenience output stream that will accumulate what is streamed to it and then, on destruction, format the accumulated string (via the <ref refid="namespaceargagg_1ae9d8a0de66b416e737bddcb36a9eddf0" kindref="member">argagg::fmt_string()</ref> function) to the provided <ref refid="cpp/io/basic_ostream" kindref="compound" external="/home/cim/pgr/pmai286/blacksmith/build-vg/_deps/argagg-src/doc/cppreference-doxygen-web.tag.xml">std::ostream</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Example use:</para>
<para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>argagg::fmt_ostream<sp/>f(std::cerr);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>f<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&quot;Usage:<sp/>&quot;<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>really_long_string<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/>&apos;\n&apos;;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/>//<sp/>on<sp/>destruction<sp/>here<sp/>the<sp/>formatted<sp/>string<sp/>will<sp/>be<sp/>streamed<sp/>to<sp/>std::cerr</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
